    <tags>project-gld gld gaming games download-client</tags>
    <summary>Project GLD is a game library and launcher that offers Lua script compatibility for finding and downloading games.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
- Library Management & Social Integration: A comprehensive hub to organize your collection with advanced search filtering, playtime tracking, and integrated achievement notifications. It features automated cloud backups for save files across various storage providers, full native joystick navigation, and an account system to follow friends' activity.
- Advanced Content Acquisition & Network Tools: A robust automated system for discovering, acquiring, and setting up games. It utilizes a high-speed download manager with peer-to-peer networking support, automated file extraction, network privacy tools (including VPN binding), and a lightweight built-in browser equipped with integrated ad and tracker blockers.
- Platform Extensibility & Customization: A highly flexible interface that caters to advanced users. It includes a complete UI theme editor, command-line interface (CLI) accessibility, and a powerful built-in Lua scripting engine. This API allows users to create custom extensions and integrate specific content sources, supplemented by built-in app achievements and PC power management utilities.]]>
    </description>
